{%- comment -%}
  Pocket Era redesign (2026-10-23) - THE product page, v2 (owner: "redo all the product pages so they are
  all the same and more simple, don't keep all the modules we had, copy how rad global did it").
  rad-global order and nothing more: photos, title / price / colour / pack / add to bag, a 2x2 icon grid,
  the drop-down boxes (Description, Tech specs, In the box, Shipping), reviews, you may also like.
  Desktop = photos stacked left + sticky buy column; phone = one big photo with a counter and arrows.
  Every product-specific word comes from the template settings; one file for every product.
  Pack rows (settings.bundles): label ~ option1 value ~ qty ~ dollars off ~ kit 1/0 ~ default 1/0 ~ sub ~ tag ~ pay units ~ offmode
    - option1 value empty = the product's only option is the colour (hoodie, orb)
    - pay units = BXGY rows (Buy 2 Get 1 = qty 3, pay 2); offmode "total" = dollars off the whole row
  Adding to cart posts the variant x qty, the $0 kit beside a kit row, any ticked add-on, then window.pgOpenCart.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign p = product -%}
{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
{%- assign short_title = s.title | default: p.title | remove_first: 'Pocket Era ' -%}{%- unless short_title contains 'Ball Cushion' -%}{%- assign short_title = short_title | remove_first: 'Legends ' -%}{%- endunless -%}{%- comment -%} owner 2026-10-25: it is the Legends Ball Cushion, keep "Legends" {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign color_opt = blank -%}{%- assign color_pos = 0 -%}
{%- for option in p.options_with_values -%}{%- if option.name contains 'Color' or option.name contains 'Colour' or option.name contains 'Character' or option.name == 'Style' -%}{%- assign color_opt = option -%}{%- assign color_pos = forloop.index -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
{%- comment -%} a second option named Size (plushies and ball cushions since 2026-10-24: Small / Large) shows as a switch above the packs; every pack row then carries the chosen size as its bundle {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign size_opt = blank -%}{%- assign size_pos = 0 -%}
{%- for option in p.options_with_values -%}{%- if option.name == 'Size' and color_pos == 1 and forloop.index == 2 -%}{%- assign size_opt = option -%}{%- assign size_pos = 2 -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign kit = blank -%}{%- if s.kit_handle != blank -%}{%- assign kit = all_products[s.kit_handle] -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign kit_id = kit.selected_or_first_available_variant.id | default: 0 -%}
{%- assign jm = p.metafields.judgeme.review_widget_data.value -%}
{%- assign rn = 0 -%}{%- assign ravg = 0.0 -%}
{%- if jm -%}{%- assign rn = jm.number_of_reviews | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign ravg = jm.average_rating | plus: 0.0 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign first_v = p.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
{%- if color_pos == 1 -%}{%- assign first_color = first_v.option1 -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign first_color = first_v.option2 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign pains = s.pains | default: '' | split: '|' -%}
{%- assign rows = s.bundles | default: '' | split: '|' -%}
{%- assign adds = s.addons | default: '' | split: '|' -%}
{%- assign specs = s.specs | default: '' | split: '|' -%}
{%- assign also = s.also | default: '' | split: ',' -%}
{%- assign seedn = 0 -%}{%- if s.photo_reviews != blank -%}{%- assign seeds = s.photo_reviews | split: ' | ' -%}{%- assign seedn = seeds.size -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign plus = '<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 14V2.5M3.5 7 8 2.5 12.5 7M5 9.5h6"/></svg>' -%}
{%- comment -%} v3 (2026-10-23 owner round): glove photo first (lead), the product clip second, interactive modules, the pinned Select bundle pill {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign lead = s.lead | strip -%}{%- assign lead_name = '' -%}{%- assign lsep = '?' -%}
{%- if lead != blank -%}{%- assign lead_name = lead | split: '?' | first | split: '/' | last -%}{%- if lead contains '?' -%}{%- assign lsep = '&' -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign clip = s.clip | strip -%}{%- assign clip_url = '' -%}
{%- if clip != blank -%}{%- if clip contains '//' -%}{%- assign clip_url = clip -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign clip_url = clip | asset_url -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign dup = 0 -%}{%- assign lead_alt = '' -%}{%- if lead_name != '' -%}{%- for m in p.media -%}{%- if m.preview_image.src contains lead_name -%}{%- assign dup = 1 -%}{%- assign lead_alt = m.alt -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign media_n = p.media.size | minus: dup -%}{%- if lead != blank -%}{%- assign media_n = media_n | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}{%- if clip_url != blank -%}{%- assign media_n = media_n | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign fl = s.float | strip -%}{%- if fl != blank -%}{%- assign media_n = media_n | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%} plushies + ball cushions (2026-10-25): every photo carries the character's name. Every product with more than one photo gets the thumbnail strip that jumps to any photo (owner "shouldn't all have the photo strip") {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} the orb's characters get names too (owner 2026-10-25 "orbs dont have names on photo either") {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign nm_vals = blank -%}{%- if size_opt != blank or s.swatch_label == 'Character' -%}{%- assign nm_vals = color_opt.values -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%} floating gallery (owner 2026-10-25 "have both plushies floating side by side then just have a lifestyle w big one as priority"): a product with
   photos whose alt ends ", floating" (plushies, ball cushions) shows only those and the ones whose alt ends ", gallery" (one lifestyle per character, the Large
   one first), in product media order: each character's float (the side-by-side when it comes in both sizes), then its room. Every character stays in the
   gallery and a pick jumps to it (owner rejected a per-character filter and a separate At home strip) {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} every product follows it since 2026-10-25 ("for all things on this site: color of item floating in white background, then lifestyle, then next color"):
   a colour product names its photos by colour; the product clip, if any, plays after the colours {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign fl_mode = false -%}
{%- for m in p.media -%}{%- if m.alt contains ', floating' -%}{%- assign fl_mode = true -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
{%- if fl_mode and nm_vals == blank -%}{%- if color_opt != blank -%}{%- assign nm_vals = color_opt.values -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign fl_mode = false -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if fl_mode -%}{%- assign media_n = 0 -%}{%- for m in p.media -%}{%- if m.alt contains ', floating' or m.alt contains ', gallery' -%}{%- assign media_n = media_n | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- if clip_url != blank -%}{%- assign media_n = media_n | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}

<div class="pr pr-page-product" id="pr">
  <div class="pr-wrap">
    <nav class="pr-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>{%- if s.crumb_url != blank -%}<a href="{{ s.crumb_url }}">{{ s.crumb | default: 'Shop' }}</a><span>/</span>{%- endif -%}<span>{{ short_title }}</span></nav>
    <div class="pr-pdp">

      {%- comment -%} the thumbnail strip is only on the orbs and the plushies (owner 2026-10-25 "take out photo strip on each page unless it's the orbs and pokemon plushies", then "take off image strip above title for poke balls") {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign strip_on = false -%}{%- if media_n > 1 -%}{%- case template.suffix -%}{%- when 'pg-plush', 'pg-crystal' -%}{%- assign strip_on = true -%}{%- endcase -%}{%- endif -%}
      <section class="pr-gal{% if strip_on %} pr-gal-rail{% endif %}" aria-label="Product photos">
        <div class="pr-gal-track">
          {%- if fl_mode -%}
          {%- comment -%} the product's first media (the gloves shot) is not in this gallery, so the first slide shown is tracked by hand for fetchpriority {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign fl_seen = false -%}
          {%- for m in p.media -%}
            {%- if m.alt contains ', gallery' -%}
              {%- capture mn -%}{%- render 'pr-photo-name', vals: nm_vals, alt: m.alt, as: 'text' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
              <div data-media="{{ m.id }}" data-name="{{ mn | escape }}" data-pick="{{ mn | escape }}|room"><img src="{{ m | image_url: width: 1200 }}" srcset="{{ m | image_url: width: 720 }} 720w, {{ m | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w, {{ m | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ m | image_url: width: 2048 }} 2048w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 56vw, 100vw" width="1200" height="1200" alt="{{ m.alt | remove: ', gallery' | escape }}" {% if fl_seen %}loading="lazy"{% else %}fetchpriority="high"{% endif %}>{%- if size_opt == blank and mn != '' -%}<span class="pr-gal-name">{{ mn }}</span>{%- endif -%}</div>
              {%- assign fl_seen = true -%}
              {%- continue -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- unless m.alt contains ', floating' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
            {%- capture mn -%}{%- render 'pr-photo-name', vals: nm_vals, alt: m.alt, as: 'text' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
            {%- assign fparts = m.alt | split: ', ' -%}{%- assign fsz = '' -%}{%- if fparts.size > 2 -%}{%- assign fsz = fparts[1] -%}{%- endif -%}{%- assign fcm = '' -%}{%- if fparts.size > 3 -%}{%- assign fcm = fparts[2] -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- assign fpair = false -%}{%- if fsz contains 'side by side' -%}{%- assign fpair = true -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- assign fw = '' -%}{%- assign ffn = m.preview_image.src | split: '?' | first | split: '/' | last | split: '.' | first -%}{%- if ffn contains '-w' -%}{%- assign fw = ffn | split: '-w' | last | split: '_' | first -%}{%- endif -%}
            <div data-media="{{ m.id }}" data-name="{{ mn | escape }}" data-pick="{{ mn | escape }}|{% if fpair %}pair{% else %}{{ fsz }}{% endif %}" class="pr-gal-fl{% if fpair %} pr-gal-fl-pair{% endif %}"{% if fpair %} style="{% render 'pr-pair-shade', name: mn %}"{% elsif fw != '' %} style="--sw:{{ fw }}%"{% endif %}><img src="{{ m | image_url: width: 1200 }}" srcset="{{ m | image_url: width: 720 }} 720w, {{ m | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw" width="1200" height="1200" alt="{{ m.alt | remove: ', floating' | escape }}" {% if fl_seen %}loading="lazy"{% else %}fetchpriority="high"{% endif %}><span class="pr-gal-name">{{ mn }}{% if fpair %} · {{ fsz | remove: ' side by side' | replace: ' and ', ' + ' }}{% elsif fsz != '' %} · {{ fsz }}{% if fcm != '' %} · {{ fcm }}{% endif %}{% endif %}</span></div>
            {%- assign fl_seen = true -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- if clip_url != blank -%}
            <div data-media="clip" class="pr-gal-clip"><video muted loop playsinline preload="none" {% if s.clip_poster != blank %}poster="{{ s.clip_poster }}"{% endif %} aria-label="{{ p.title | escape }} up close"><source src="{{ clip_url }}" type="video/mp4"></video></div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- else -%}
          {%- if fl != blank -%}
            <div data-media="float" class="pr-gal-float{% if size_opt != blank %} pr-gal-float-cut{% endif %}"><img src="{{ fl | file_img_url: '1200x' }}" srcset="{{ fl | file_img_url: '720x' }} 720w, {{ fl | file_img_url: '1200x' }} 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 56vw, 100vw" width="1200" height="1200" alt="{{ p.selected_or_first_available_variant.option1 | escape }}" fetchpriority="high">{%- if size_opt != blank -%}<span class="pr-gal-name">{{ p.selected_or_first_available_variant.option1 }}</span>{%- endif -%}</div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if lead != blank -%}
            <div data-media="lead"><img src="{{ lead }}{{ lsep }}width=1200" srcset="{{ lead }}{{ lsep }}width=720 720w, {{ lead }}{{ lsep }}width=1200 1200w, {{ lead }}{{ lsep }}width=1600 1600w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 56vw, 100vw" width="1200" height="1200" alt="{{ lead_alt | default: p.title | escape }}" {% if fl != blank %}loading="lazy"{% else %}fetchpriority="high"{% endif %}>{%- if nm_vals != blank -%}{%- render 'pr-photo-name', vals: nm_vals, alt: lead_alt -%}{%- endif -%}</div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if clip_url != blank -%}
            <div data-media="clip" class="pr-gal-clip"><video muted loop playsinline preload="none" {% if s.clip_poster != blank %}poster="{{ s.clip_poster }}"{% endif %} aria-label="{{ p.title | escape }} up close"><source src="{{ clip_url }}" type="video/mp4"></video></div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- for m in p.media -%}
            {%- if lead_name != '' and m.preview_image.src contains lead_name -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- if m.media_type == 'image' -%}
              <div data-media="{{ m.id }}"><img src="{{ m | image_url: width: 1200 }}" srcset="{{ m | image_url: width: 720 }} 720w, {{ m | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w, {{ m | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ m | image_url: width: 2048 }} 2048w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 56vw, 100vw" width="1200" height="1200" alt="{{ m.alt | default: p.title | escape }}" {% if forloop.first and lead == blank %}fetchpriority="high"{% else %}loading="lazy"{% endif %}>{%- if nm_vals != blank -%}{%- render 'pr-photo-name', vals: nm_vals, alt: m.alt -%}{%- endif -%}</div>
            {%- elsif m.media_type == 'video' -%}
              <div data-media="{{ m.id }}">{{ m | video_tag: autoplay: true, loop: true, muted: true, controls: false, playsinline: true, preload: 'metadata' }}</div>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="pr-gal-bar">
          <span class="pr-gal-n">1 \ {{ media_n }}</span>
          <div class="pr-gal-arr">
            <button type="button" class="pr-gal-prev" aria-label="Previous photo"><svg viewBox="0 0 26 14"><path d="M25 7H2M7 1 1 7l6 6"/></svg></button>
            <button type="button" class="pr-gal-next" aria-label="Next photo"><svg viewBox="0 0 26 14"><path d="M1 7h23M19 1l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
          </div>
        </div>
        {%- if strip_on -%}<div class="pr-gal-thumbs" aria-label="All photos"></div>{%- endif -%}
      </section>

      <section class="pr-buy" data-pr-product="{{ p.id }}">
        <div class="pr-buy-top">
          <div>
            <h1 class="pr-title">{{ short_title }}</h1>
            {%- if s.subtitle != blank -%}<p class="pr-sub">{{ s.subtitle }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          </div>
          {%- if s.tag != blank -%}<span class="pr-tag">{{ s.tag }}</span>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
        {%- if rn > 0 -%}
          <a class="pr-rate" href="#pr-reviews"><b aria-hidden="true" class="pr-stars" style="--pct:{{ ravg | times: 20 | at_most: 100 }}%">{%- assign rr = ravg | round -%}{%- for i in (1..5) -%}{%- if i <= rr -%}&#9733;{%- else -%}&#9734;{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}</b> {{ ravg | round: 1 }} &middot; {{ rn }} reviews</a>
        {%- elsif seedn > 0 -%}
          <a class="pr-rate" href="#pr-reviews"><b aria-hidden="true" class="pr-stars" style="--pct:100%">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</b> 5.0 &middot; {{ seedn }} reviews</a>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="pr-price">{%- if first_v.compare_at_price > first_v.price -%}<s>{{ first_v.compare_at_price | money }}</s>{%- endif -%}<span class="pr-price-now">{{ first_v.price | money }}</span></div>

        {%- if pains.size > 0 and pains[0] != blank -%}
        <div class="pr-bens">
          {%- for pn in pains limit: 4 -%}
            {%- assign f = pn | split: '~' -%}
            {%- assign k = f[0] | strip | downcase -%}
            <div>{%- case k -%}
                {%- when 'games' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M38 12v25a3 3 0 0 1-3 3"/><rect x="8" y="6" width="26" height="31" rx="2.5"/><path d="M8 12h26M12 6v3.5M16 6v3.5M20 6v3.5M24 6v3.5M28 6v3.5"/><rect x="12" y="16" width="18" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M14.5 25.5l4.5-5 3 3 2-2 3.5 4"/><circle cx="26" cy="19.5" r="1.4"/><path d="M14 37v4.5h14V37M17.5 41.5v-2.5M21 41.5v-2.5M24.5 41.5v-2.5"/></svg>
                {%- when 'screen' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="6" width="38" height="28" rx="3.5"/><rect x="9" y="10" width="30" height="20" rx="1"/><path d="M12 26.5l6-7 4 4.5 3-3 5.5 5.5"/><circle cx="31" cy="15.5" r="2.2"/><path d="M12 13.5h3M12 16h2"/><path d="M5 41h38M5 38.5v5M43 38.5v5M9 41l3-2M9 41l3 2M39 41l-3-2M39 41l-3 2"/></svg>
                {%- when 'battery' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="14" width="36" height="20" rx="3.5"/><path d="M40 20h3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3"/><path d="M9 19v10M13.5 19v10M18 19v10"/><path d="M29 17l-4.5 7.5h5.5L25.5 31"/></svg>
                {%- when 'light' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="27" r="10"/><circle cx="24" cy="27" r="5.5"/><path d="M21.5 25.5a3 3 0 0 1 3-2"/><circle cx="24" cy="27" r="14" stroke-dasharray="1.5 3.2"/><path d="M24 4.5v4.5M11 9.5l3 3M37 9.5l-3 3M5 21h4M39 21h4"/><path d="M14 44h20"/></svg>
                {%- when 'wifi' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 18.5a27 27 0 0 1 38 0"/><path d="M10.5 24a19 19 0 0 1 27 0"/><path d="M16 29.5a11 11 0 0 1 16 0"/><circle cx="24" cy="35.5" r="2.6"/><path d="M38 31v11M34 38l4 4 4-4"/></svg>
                {%- when 'ship' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h24v20H4zM28 19h8l6 7v6H28z"/><circle cx="12" cy="35" r="3.5"/><circle cx="34" cy="35" r="3.5"/><path d="M8 18h10M8 23h7"/></svg>
                {%- when 'remote' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="15" y="4" width="18" height="40" rx="5"/><circle cx="24" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.5 20h3M25.5 20h3M19.5 25h3M25.5 25h3M19.5 30h3M25.5 30h3"/><path d="M21 37h6"/><path d="M38 9a8 8 0 0 1 0 10M41.5 6a13 13 0 0 1 0 16"/></svg>
                {%- when 'timer' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="21" cy="27" r="15"/><path d="M21 17v10l6.5 4"/><path d="M17 6.5h8M21 6.5V12M34.5 13.5l2.5-2.5"/><path d="M42 5.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 4 11.5 7.5 7.5 0 0 1-4-11.5z"/></svg>
                {%- when 'usb' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="16" y="3.5" width="16" height="9" rx="4.5"/><path d="M20.5 8h7"/><path d="M14.5 12.5h19v10a3 3 0 0 1-3 3h-13a3 3 0 0 1-3-3z"/><path d="M19 17.5h10"/><path d="M24 25.5v6c0 6 10 5 10 12"/><path d="M13 33l-3.5 5.5h5L11 44"/></svg>
                {%- when 'warm' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 8h36v26l-8 8H6z"/><path d="M34 42v-6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><path d="M10 15c2.5-2.5 4.5 2.5 7 0s4.5 2.5 7 0 4.5 2.5 7 0 4.5 2.5 7 0M10 22c2.5-2.5 4.5 2.5 7 0s4.5 2.5 7 0 4.5 2.5 7 0 4.5 2.5 7 0M10 29c2.5-2.5 4.5 2.5 7 0s4.5 2.5 7 0 4.5 2.5 7 0M10 36c2.5-2.5 4.5 2.5 7 0s4.5 2.5 7 0"/></svg>
                {%- when 'size' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 17V6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 2.5-2.5h9A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 31 6.5V17"/><rect x="19.5" y="6.5" width="9" height="7" rx="1"/><path d="M7 17h34v13c0 7-7 11-17 13-10-2-17-6-17-13z"/><path d="M10.5 21.5h27" stroke-dasharray="2 2.2"/><circle cx="10.5" cy="19" r="1.2"/><circle cx="37.5" cy="19" r="1.2"/></svg>
                {%- when 'speaker' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="9" width="18" height="30" rx="3"/><circle cx="14" cy="17" r="3"/><circle cx="14" cy="29.5" r="6"/><circle cx="14" cy="29.5" r="1.6"/><path d="M29 18.5a8 8 0 0 1 0 11M33.5 14a14.5 14.5 0 0 1 0 20M38 9.5a21 21 0 0 1 0 29"/></svg>
                {%- when 'star' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 6l2.8 8.2L30 17l-8.2 2.8L19 28l-2.8-8.2L8 17l8.2-2.8z"/><path d="M36 26l1.6 4.4L42 32l-4.4 1.6L36 38l-1.6-4.4L30 32l4.4-1.6z"/><circle cx="38" cy="9" r="1.6"/><circle cx="9" cy="37" r="1.6"/><circle cx="21" cy="42" r="1.1"/><path d="M38 9l-6 6M9 37l12 5" stroke-dasharray="1.4 2.6"/></svg>
                {%- when 'rotate' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="21" r="12"/><rect x="16" y="15.5" width="16" height="11" rx="5.5"/><path d="M19 19a3 3 0 0 1 3-2"/><path d="M7 33c5 7 29 7 34 0"/><path d="M36.5 30.5l4.5 2.5-3 4.5"/><path d="M11 29.5c-1.5 1-2.5 2-3.5 3"/></svg>
                {%- when 'orb' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="19" r="14"/><path d="M15 12a11 11 0 0 1 6.5-4.5"/><path d="M18.5 24l3.5-7 2.5 4 2.5-3 3 6"/><circle cx="24" cy="14" r="1.3"/><path d="M13 35.5h22l-2.5 8h-17z"/><path d="M16.5 32.5h15"/><path d="M15.5 39.5h17"/></svg>
                {%- when 'glow' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 34h26l-3 9H14z"/><ellipse cx="24" cy="34" rx="13" ry="3"/><path d="M24 7v18M15 10.5l4 13M33 10.5l-4 13M8 17l7.5 8.5M40 17l-7.5 8.5"/><path d="M17 39h14"/></svg>
                {%- when 'shelf' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="12" r="7"/><path d="M19.5 9.5a5 5 0 0 1 3-2.5"/><path d="M18.5 22l1.5-4h8l1.5 4"/><path d="M7 22h34v4H7zM10 26v18M38 26v18M10 35h28"/><rect x="18" y="28.5" width="12" height="4" rx="1"/><circle cx="24" cy="30.5" r=".6"/></svg>
                {%- when 'set' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="18.5" r="10.5"/><path d="M17.5 14a8 8 0 0 1 4.5-3.8"/><path d="M19 31.5h10"/><path d="M16.5 34.5h15l-2 8.5h-11z"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="29" r="5.5"/><path d="M4.6 27.2a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 1.9-2"/><path d="M3 37.5h9l-1.3 5.5h-6.4z"/><circle cx="40.5" cy="29" r="5.5"/><path d="M37.6 27.2a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 1.9-2"/><path d="M36 37.5h9l-1.3 5.5h-6.4z"/></svg>
                {%- when 'hood' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 9c3-4 13-4 16 0 3.5 2.5 5.5 6 5.5 10.5v3l5.5 5.5-3.5 6-4-3.5V44h-23V30.5l-4 3.5-3.5-6 5.5-5.5v-3C10.5 15 12.5 11.5 16 9z"/><path d="M18 11c0 8 12 8 12 0"/><path d="M21.5 17v6.5M26.5 17v6.5"/><path d="M17.5 35.5h13l1.5 5.5h-16z"/></svg>
                {%- when 'pad' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 15h18c5.5 0 8.5 4.5 9.5 11l1 7.5c.6 4.5-4.5 6.5-7.5 3.5l-5-5H17l-5 5c-3 3-8.1 1-7.5-3.5l1-7.5c1-6.5 4-11 9.5-11z"/><path d="M14 21v7M10.5 24.5h7"/><circle cx="33" cy="21.5" r="1.4"/><circle cx="36.5" cy="25" r="1.4"/><circle cx="29.5" cy="25" r="1.4"/><circle cx="33" cy="28.5" r="1.4"/><path d="M21.5 23.5h5"/></svg>
                {%- when 'sd' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5h16l6 6v29a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H15a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V8a3 3 0 0 1 3-3z"/><path d="M18 5v5M22 5v5M26 5v5M30 5v5"/><path d="M24.5 20v13M18 26.5h13"/></svg>
                {%- when 'rainbow' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 35a19 19 0 0 1 38 0"/><path d="M11 35a13 13 0 0 1 26 0"/><path d="M17 35a7 7 0 0 1 14 0"/><path d="M3 39h42"/><path d="M38 9l1.2 2.8L42 13l-2.8 1.2L38 17l-1.2-2.8L34 13l2.8-1.2z"/></svg>
                {%- when 'tape' -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="24" r="13"/><circle cx="18" cy="24" r="4.5"/><path d="M18 11h26v8H31"/><path d="M35 11v4M39 11v4M43 11v3"/><path d="M44 19v3"/></svg>
                {%- else -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="18"/><path d="M16 24.5l5.5 5.5 11-12"/></svg>
                {%- endcase -%}<b>{{ f[1] | strip }}</b>{%- if f[2] != blank -%}<small>{{ f[2] | strip }}</small>{%- endif -%}</div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if color_opt != blank -%}
        <div class="pr-blk">
          <div class="pr-lbl">{{ s.swatch_label | default: 'Color' }} <span class="pr-sw-name">{{ first_color }}</span></div>
          {%- assign con = color_opt.name | downcase -%}{%- assign plain_sw = false -%}{%- if con == 'color' or con == 'colour' -%}{%- assign plain_sw = true -%}{%- endif -%}
          <div class="pr-sw{% if plain_sw %} pr-sw-dots{% endif %}" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ s.swatch_label | default: 'Color' | escape }}">
            {%- for c in color_opt.values -%}
              {%- assign cv = blank -%}{%- assign c_ok = false -%}
              {%- for v in p.variants -%}{%- if color_pos == 1 -%}{%- assign vc = v.option1 -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign vc = v.option2 -%}{%- endif -%}{%- if vc == c -%}{%- if v.available -%}{%- assign c_ok = true -%}{%- endif -%}{%- if cv == blank or v.featured_media -%}{%- assign cv = v -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
              {%- comment -%} a colour nobody can buy in any pack is not shown (owner 2026-10-24: R36S Ultra green showed but could not be picked; it came off the Ultra on 2026-10-12) {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- unless c_ok -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
              {%- assign sw_img = blank -%}{%- if cv.featured_media -%}{%- assign sw_img = cv.featured_media -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign cin = ' in ' | append: c -%}{%- for m in p.media -%}{%- if sw_img == blank and m.alt contains cin -%}{%- assign sw_img = m -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- if sw_img == blank -%}{%- assign cw = c | split: ' ' | last -%}{%- for m in p.media -%}{%- if sw_img == blank and m.alt contains cw -%}{%- assign sw_img = m -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}
              <button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="{% if first_color == c %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-color="{{ c | escape }}" aria-label="{{ c | escape }}" title="{{ c | escape }}">
                {%- assign hx = c | handleize | replace: 'shadow-black','#17141c' | replace: 'ice-white','#f1eff5' | replace: 'mystic-purple','#7c4dff' | replace: 'crimson-red','#c62839' | replace: 'emerald-green','#1f8a5b' | replace: 'sapphire-blue','#2b57c9' | replace: 'solar-orange','#f08a24' | replace: 'cocoa-brown','#6b4a3a' | replace: 'blush-pink','#e9a7b8' | replace: 'sand-beige','#d9c7a7' -%}{%- capture hx2 -%}{%- render 'pr-swatch-hex', h: p.handle, c: c -%}{%- endcapture -%}{%- if hx2 != blank -%}{%- assign hx = hx2 | strip -%}{%- endif -%}{%- if plain_sw or sw_img == blank -%}<i style="background:{{ hx }}"></i>{%- else -%}<img src="{{ sw_img | image_url: width: 140 }}" width="70" height="70" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}
              </button>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if size_pos == 2 -%}
        <div class="pr-blk pr-szw-blk">
          <div class="pr-lbl">Pick your size</div>
          <div class="pr-szw" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Size">
            {%- for sv in size_opt.values -%}
            <button type="button" class="pr-szw-b" role="radio" aria-checked="{% if first_v.option2 == sv %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-size="{{ sv | escape }}"><b>{{ sv }}</b><span class="pr-szw-cm"></span><span class="pr-szw-p"></span></button>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="pr-blk">
          {%- if rows.size > 0 and rows[0] != blank -%}
          <div class="pr-lbl">{{ s.rows_label | default: 'Pick your pack' }}</div>
          <div class="pr-rows" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Pack">
            {%- for r in rows -%}
              {%- assign f = r | split: '~' -%}
              {%- assign off_c = f[3] | default: '0' | strip | times: 100 | round -%}
              {%- assign row_b = f[1] | strip -%}{%- if row_b == blank and size_pos == 2 -%}{%- assign row_b = first_v.option2 -%}{%- endif -%}
              <div class="pr-row" role="radio" tabindex="0" aria-checked="false" data-bundle="{{ row_b | escape }}" data-qty="{{ f[2] | default: '1' | strip }}" data-off="{{ off_c }}" data-kit="{{ f[4] | default: '0' | strip }}" data-default="{{ f[5] | default: '0' | strip }}" data-pay="{{ f[8] | strip }}" data-offmode="{{ f[9] | default: 'each' | strip }}">
                <span class="pr-radio"></span>
                <span class="pr-row-t">{{ f[0] | strip }}{%- if f[7] != blank -%}<span class="pr-tag pr-tag-soft">{{ f[7] | strip }}</span>{%- endif -%}</span>
                <span class="pr-row-p"></span>
                {%- comment -%} "protection kit" in a pack row opens what is in it (owner 2026-10-26 "we don't say what the protection kit is ... a question mark next to it where they click and it tells them what's in it") {%- endcomment -%}
                {%- assign row_s = f[6] | strip | escape -%}{%- if kit != blank and row_s contains 'protection kit' -%}{%- assign row_s = row_s | replace: 'protection kit', '<button type="button" class="pr-kit-q" data-kit-q aria-haspopup="dialog">protection kit<i aria-hidden="true"></i></button>' -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- if f[6] != blank -%}<span class="pr-row-s">{{ row_s }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              </div>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
          {%- if kit != blank -%}
          <div class="pr-kit" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="pr-kit-h">
            <div class="pr-kit-card">
              <button type="button" class="pr-kit-x" aria-label="Close"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5l14 14M19 5 5 19"/></svg></button>
              {%- if kit.featured_image -%}<img class="pr-kit-img" src="{{ kit.featured_image | image_url: width: 1000 }}" srcset="{{ kit.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ kit.featured_image | image_url: width: 1000 }} 1000w" sizes="(min-width: 560px) 520px, 100vw" alt="{{ kit.featured_image.alt | escape }}" width="1000" height="{{ 1000 | divided_by: kit.featured_image.aspect_ratio | round }}" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}
              <p class="pr-kit-k">Free with the Max Bundle</p>
              <h3 id="pr-kit-h">What's in the protection kit</h3>
              {%- assign kit_items = s.kit_items | split: '|' -%}
              {%- if kit_items.size > 0 -%}<ul class="pr-kit-list">{%- for it in kit_items -%}<li>{{ it | strip }}</li>{%- endfor -%}</ul>{%- else -%}<p class="pr-kit-d">{{ kit.description | strip_html }}</p>{%- endif -%}
              <p class="pr-kit-n">Duo Max comes with two kits, one for each console.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- elsif p.variants.size > 1 and color_opt == blank -%}
          <div class="pr-lbl">{{ p.options_with_values[0].name }}</div>
          <div class="pr-rows" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ p.options_with_values[0].name | escape }}">
            {%- for v in p.variants -%}
              <div class="pr-row" role="radio" tabindex="0" aria-checked="false" data-bundle="{{ v.option1 | escape }}" data-qty="1" data-off="0" data-kit="0" data-default="{% if v == first_v %}1{% else %}0{% endif %}" data-pay="" data-offmode="each"><span class="pr-radio"></span><span class="pr-row-t">{{ v.option1 }}</span><span class="pr-row-p"></span></div>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
          {%- else -%}
          <div class="pr-rows pr-rows-hidden" hidden><div class="pr-row" role="radio" aria-checked="true" data-bundle="" data-qty="1" data-off="0" data-kit="0" data-default="1" data-pay="" data-offmode="each"><span class="pr-row-p"></span></div></div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- if adds.size > 0 and adds[0] != blank -%}
        <div class="pr-blk">
          <div class="pr-lbl">Add to it <span>optional</span></div>
          <div class="pr-adds">
            {%- for a in adds -%}
              {%- assign f = a | split: '~' -%}
              {%- assign hk = f[0] | strip -%}
              {%- assign ap = all_products[hk] -%}
              {%- if ap != blank and ap.available -%}
                {%- assign av = ap.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
                <div class="pr-add" role="checkbox" tabindex="0" aria-checked="false" data-variant="{{ av.id }}" data-price="{{ av.price }}">
                  <span class="pr-check"></span>
                  <img src="{{ ap.featured_image | image_url: width: 96 }}" width="48" height="48" alt="" loading="lazy">
                  <span><span class="pr-add-t">{{ f[1] | default: ap.title | strip }}</span>{%- if f[2] != blank -%}<br><span class="pr-add-s">{{ f[2] | strip }}</span>{%- endif -%}</span>
                  <span class="pr-add-p">{%- if av.compare_at_price > av.price -%}<s>{{ av.compare_at_price | money }}</s>{%- endif -%}+{{ av.price | money }}{%- if av.compare_at_price > av.price -%}<i class="pr-row-save">Save {{ av.compare_at_price | minus: av.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: av.compare_at_price | round }}%</i>{%- endif -%}</span>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="pr-cta">
          <button type="button" class="pr-btn pr-btn-wide pr-atc" data-label="{{ s.cta | default: 'Add to bag' }}">{{ s.cta | default: 'Add to bag' }}</button>
          <p class="pr-cta-note">{{ s.cta_note | default: 'Free tracked shipping · ships in 1 to 2 business days' }}</p>
        </div>



        <div class="pr-acc">
          <details {% if s.open_desc %}open{% endif %}>
            <summary>Description {{ plus }}</summary>
            <div class="pr-acc-body">{%- if s.description != blank -%}{{ s.description }}{%- else -%}{%- comment -%} the stored descriptions are long pages that open with a heading repeating the product name (strip_html glued it to the next line: "Long SessionsA hoodie"). Headings are skipped and whole paragraphs kept until about 40 words, stopping at the next heading, so nothing is cut mid-sentence; the rest lives in Tech specs / In the box {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- assign dsrc = p.description | replace: '<h1', '@@B@@@@H@@<h1' | replace: '<h2', '@@B@@@@H@@<h2' | replace: '<h3', '@@B@@@@H@@<h3' | replace: '<h4', '@@B@@@@H@@<h4' | replace: '</h1>', '@@B@@' | replace: '</h2>', '@@B@@' | replace: '</h3>', '@@B@@' | replace: '</h4>', '@@B@@' | replace: '</p>', '@@B@@' | replace: '</div>', '@@B@@' | replace: '</li>', '@@B@@' | replace: '<br>', ' ' | replace: '<br/>', ' ' | replace: '<br />', ' ' | strip_html | replace: '&nbsp;', ' ' -%}
              {%- assign dblocks = dsrc | split: '@@B@@' -%}{%- assign dwords = 0 -%}
              {%- for b in dblocks -%}
                {%- assign bt = b | strip -%}
                {%- if bt == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- if bt contains '@@H@@' -%}{%- if dwords > 0 -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- assign bw = bt | split: ' ' | size -%}{%- assign dtot = dwords | plus: bw -%}
                {%- if dwords > 0 and dtot > 75 -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
                <p>{{ bt }}</p>
                {%- assign dwords = dtot -%}
                {%- if dwords >= 40 -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            {%- endif -%}</div>
          </details>
          {%- if specs.size > 0 and specs[0] != blank -%}
          <details>
            <summary>{%- if size_opt != blank -%}Specs{%- else -%}Tech specs{%- endif %} {{ plus }}</summary>{%- comment -%} plushies and ball cushions are not tech (owner 2026-10-25) {%- endcomment -%}
            <div class="pr-acc-body"><table>{%- for sp in specs -%}{%- assign f = sp | split: '~' -%}<tr><td>{{ f[0] | strip }}</td><td>{{ f[1] | strip }}</td></tr>{%- endfor -%}</table></div>
          </details>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if s.box != blank -%}
          <details>
            <summary>In the box {{ plus }}</summary>
            <div class="pr-acc-body"><ul>{%- assign bx = s.box | split: '|' -%}{%- for b in bx -%}<li>{{ b | strip }}</li>{%- endfor -%}</ul></div>
          </details>
          {%- endif -%}
          <details>
            <summary>Shipping &amp; returns {{ plus }}</summary>
            <div class="pr-acc-body"><p>{{ s.shipping | default: 'Free tracked shipping on every order. Orders leave the warehouse in 1 to 2 business days and most arrive within 7 to 12 days. You get a tracking link by email the moment it ships.' }}</p><p class="pr-final">All sales final.</p></div>
          </details>
          {%- if s.faq != blank -%}
          {%- assign fq = s.faq | split: '|' -%}
          {%- for q in fq -%}{%- assign f = q | split: '~' -%}
          <details><summary>{{ f[0] | strip }} {{ plus }}</summary><div class="pr-acc-body"><p>{{ f[1] | strip }}</p></div></details>
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- assign sizes = s.sizes | default: '' | split: '|' -%}
  {%- assign has_sizes = false -%}{%- if sizes.size > 1 and sizes[0] != blank -%}{%- assign has_sizes = true -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign m1_rows = '' -%}
  {%- if s.play_tabs != blank -%}{%- assign m1_rows = s.play_tabs -%}
  {%- elsif s.play_on != blank and s.play_off != blank -%}{%- capture m1_rows -%}{{ s.play_on_label | default: 'Room lights on' }} ~ {{ s.play_on }} | {{ s.play_off_label | default: 'Lights down' }} ~ {{ s.play_off }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign m2_rows = s.tabs2 | default: '' -%}
  {%- assign mod_list = s.mods | default: '' | remove: ' ' -%}
  {%- if mod_list == '' -%}{%- if m1_rows != '' -%}{%- assign mod_list = 'play' -%}{%- endif -%}{%- if has_sizes -%}{%- assign mod_list = mod_list | append: ',size' -%}{%- elsif m2_rows != '' -%}{%- assign mod_list = mod_list | append: ',tabs2' -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign mods_a = mod_list | split: ',' -%}
  {%- assign kicks = s.kickers | default: '' | split: '|' -%}
  {%- if mods_a.size > 0 -%}
  <section class="pr-sec pr-sec-tight pr-mods"><div class="pr-wrap"><div class="pr-mods-grid">
    {%- for mk in mods_a -%}
      {%- if mk == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- assign kick_html = '' -%}{%- for kx in kicks -%}{%- assign kf = kx | split: '~' -%}{%- assign kn = kf[0] | strip -%}{%- if kn == mk and kf[1] != blank -%}{%- capture kick_html -%}<p class="pr-kick">{{ kf[1] | strip }}</p>{%- endcapture -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
      {%- case mk -%}
      {%- when 'size' -%}
      {%- if has_sizes -%}
        {%- assign simg = s.size_img | strip -%}{%- assign simg_u = '' -%}{%- if simg contains '//' -%}{%- assign simg_u = simg -%}{%- elsif simg != blank -%}{%- assign simg_u = simg | asset_url -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign max_in = 0.0 -%}{%- for z in sizes -%}{%- assign f = z | split: '~' -%}{%- assign iv = f[1] | strip | times: 1.0 -%}{%- if iv > max_in -%}{%- assign max_in = iv -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
        <div class="pr-mod pr-size" data-pr-size data-max="{{ max_in }}">
          {{ kick_html }}<h2 class="pr-h2">{{ s.size_title | default: 'Screen size.' }}</h2>
          <div class="pr-size-stage"><div class="pr-size-frame">{%- if simg_u != blank -%}<img class="pr-size-ghost" src="{{ simg_u }}" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<div class="pr-size-box" style="--r:1">{%- if simg_u != blank -%}<img src="{{ simg_u }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<span class="pr-size-tag"></span></div></div></div>
          <div class="pr-tabs" role="tablist">{%- for z in sizes -%}{%- assign f = z | split: '~' -%}{%- assign zi = f[1] | strip -%}{%- assign zl = f[0] | strip -%}<button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="{% if forloop.last %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-i="{{ forloop.index0 }}" data-in="{{ zi }}" data-tag="{{ zi }}&Prime; {{ zl | escape }}"><b>{{ zi }}&Prime;</b> {{ zl }}</button>{%- endfor -%}</div>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- when 'math' -%}
        {%- assign mrows = s.math_rows | default: '' | split: '|' -%}
        {%- if mrows.size > 0 -%}
        {%- assign mtot = 0 -%}{%- for r in mrows -%}{%- assign f = r | split: '~' -%}{%- assign mv = f[1] | strip | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign mtot = mtot | plus: mv -%}{%- endfor -%}
        {%- assign mp = p.price_min -%}
        <div class="pr-mod pr-math" data-pr-math data-price="{{ mp }}">
          {{ kick_html }}<h2 class="pr-h2">{{ s.math_title | default: 'Do the math.' }}</h2>
          <div class="pr-math-list" role="group" aria-label="Systems it plays">{%- for r in mrows -%}{%- assign f = r | split: '~' -%}<button type="button" class="pr-math-sys" aria-pressed="true" data-v="{{ f[1] | strip }}"><span>{{ f[0] | strip }}</span><b>${{ f[1] | strip }}</b></button>{%- endfor -%}</div>
          <div class="pr-math-cmp">
            <div class="pr-math-line pr-math-them"><div class="pr-math-top"><span>{{ s.math_them | default: 'Those consoles, bought used' }}</span><b data-math-total>${{ mtot }}</b></div><div class="pr-math-track"><i data-math-them style="width:100%"></i></div><small>{{ s.math_them_sub | default: 'Hardware only. Not one game.' }}</small></div>
            <div class="pr-math-line pr-math-us"><div class="pr-math-top"><span>{{ short_title }}</span><b>{{ mp | money }}</b></div><div class="pr-math-track"><i data-math-us style="width:{{ mp | times: 1.0 | divided_by: mtot | round: 1 }}%"></i></div><small>{{ s.math_us_sub | default: 'Every system in one, games preloaded.' }}</small></div>
          </div>
          {%- if s.math_note != blank -%}<p class="pr-mod-note">{{ s.math_note }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- when 'hem' -%}
        {%- assign hrows = s.hem_rows | default: '' | split: '|' -%}
        {%- if hrows.size > 0 -%}
        <div class="pr-mod pr-hem" data-pr-hem data-len="{{ s.hem_len | default: '125' }}">
          {{ kick_html }}<h2 class="pr-h2">{{ s.hem_title | default: 'Where the hem lands.' }}</h2>
          <div class="pr-hem-stage"><svg viewBox="0 0 260 250" role="img" aria-label="How long the hoodie is on you"></svg><span class="pr-hem-tag"></span></div>
          <div class="pr-tabs" role="tablist">{%- for r in hrows -%}{%- assign f = r | split: '~' -%}<button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="{% if forloop.index == 2 %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-h="{{ f[1] | strip }}" data-tag="{{ f[2] | strip | escape }}">{{ f[0] | strip }}</button>{%- endfor -%}</div>
          {%- if s.hem_note != blank -%}<p class="pr-mod-note">{{ s.hem_note }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- when 'play' or 'tabs2' -%}
        {%- if mk == 'play' -%}{%- assign rows_s = m1_rows -%}{%- assign mt = s.play_title -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign rows_s = m2_rows -%}{%- assign mt = s.tabs2_title -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- if rows_s != '' -%}
        {%- assign rws = rows_s | split: '|' -%}
        <div class="pr-mod pr-tabmod" data-pr-tabmod>
          {{ kick_html }}{%- if mt != blank -%}<h2 class="pr-h2">{{ mt }}</h2>{%- endif -%}
          <div class="pr-tm-stage">
          {%- for r in rws -%}{%- assign f = r | split: '~' -%}{%- assign u = f[1] | strip -%}{%- assign uu = u -%}
            {%- if u contains '//' -%}{%- if u contains '/s/files/' -%}{%- if u contains '?' -%}{%- assign uu = u | append: '&width=1200' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign uu = u | append: '?width=1200' -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign uu = u | asset_url -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- comment -%} owner 2026-10-25 "all photos on the site need to be top of the line resolution": the 2048 px module photos are offered at full size to retina screens {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- assign tss = '' -%}{%- if u contains '/s/files/' -%}{%- assign tsep = '?' -%}{%- if u contains '?' -%}{%- assign tsep = '&' -%}{%- endif -%}{%- capture tss -%}{{ u }}{{ tsep }}width=800 800w, {{ u }}{{ tsep }}width=1200 1200w, {{ u }}{{ tsep }}width=1600 1600w, {{ u }}{{ tsep }}width=2048 2048w{%- endcapture -%}{%- endif -%}
            <img class="pr-tm-img{% if forloop.first %} on{% endif %}" data-i="{{ forloop.index0 }}" src="{{ uu }}"{% if tss != '' %} srcset="{{ tss }}" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 46vw, 100vw"{% endif %} alt="{{ f[0] | strip | escape }}" loading="lazy">
          {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
          <div class="{% if rws.size == 2 %}pr-switch{% else %}pr-tabs{% endif %}" role="tablist">{%- for r in rws -%}{%- assign f = r | split: '~' -%}<button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-i="{{ forloop.index0 }}">{{ f[0] | strip }}</button>{%- endfor -%}</div>
        </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endcase -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div></div></section>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} owner 2026-10-24 "the you may also like bar should be full" (desktop and phone): the hand-picked list first, then every other live product from Shop all
     (add-ons, shipping protection, drafts and this product skipped), up to 8 cards {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign also_pool = s.also | default: '' -%}
  {%- for cp in collections['shop-all'].products -%}{%- unless cp.tags contains 'addon' or cp.tags contains 'nc-protection' or cp.handle == 'shipping-protection' -%}{%- assign also_pool = also_pool | append: ',' | append: cp.handle -%}{%- endunless -%}{%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign also = also_pool | split: ',' -%}{%- assign also_seen = ',' | append: p.handle | append: ',' -%}{%- assign also_n = 0 -%}
  {%- if also.size > 0 -%}
  {%- assign afl = '' -%}{%- assign asub = '' -%}{%- case p.handle -%}{%- when 'pocket-era-r36s-ultra-x' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-ultramax.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '4.5-inch · up to 40K games' -%}{%- when 'pocket-era-r36s-ultra' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-r36s-ultra.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '4-inch · up to 40K games' -%}{%- when 'pocket-era-r36-pro-2' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-r36s-pro.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '3.5-inch · up to 40K games' -%}{%- when 'pocket-era-r36h' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-r36h-pro.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '3.5-inch · up to 20K games' -%}{%- when 'pocket-era-r36h-ultra' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-r36h-ultra.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '4.2-inch · up to 30K games' -%}{%- when 'pocket-era-astronaut-galaxy-projector' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-projector.png' -%}{%- assign asub = 'Nebula · 8 modes' -%}{%- when 'legends-eden-hoodie' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-hoodie.png' -%}{%- assign asub = 'Hoodie blanket' -%}{%- when 'pokemon-crystal-ball-3d-pikachu-gengar-mewtwo-night-light-lamp-pokeball-3d-glass-pokemon-crystal-ball-statue-kids-birthday-gift' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-orb-v2.png' -%}{%- assign asub = 'Lit crystal orb' -%}{%- when 'mega-legends-plushie' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-plush.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '25 characters · Small or Large' -%}{%- when 'legends-ball-cushion' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-ball.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '4 designs · Small or Large' -%}{%- endcase -%}
  {%- assign me_img = p.featured_image | image_url: width: 700 -%}{%- if afl != '' -%}{%- assign me_img = afl | file_img_url: '700x' -%}{%- endif -%}
  <section class="pr-sec pr-also" data-pr-also data-me-url="{{ p.url }}" data-me-title="{{ short_title | escape }}" data-me-img="{{ me_img }}" {%- assign mv = p.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}data-me-price="{{ mv.price | money | escape }}"{% if mv.compare_at_price > mv.price %}{%- assign msv = mv.compare_at_price | minus: mv.price -%} data-me-cap="{{ mv.compare_at_price | money | escape }}" data-me-save="Save {{ msv | money_without_trailing_zeros | escape }} ({{ msv | times: 100 | divided_by: mv.compare_at_price }}%)"{% endif %} data-me-sub="{{ asub | escape }}" data-me-float="{% if afl != '' %}1{% endif %}"><div class="pr-wrap">
    <p class="pr-slash">You may also like</p>
    <div class="pr-also-tabs" role="tablist"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-also="rec">Recommended</button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-also="recent" hidden>Recently viewed</button></div>
    <div class="pr-also-rail" data-also-pane="rec">
      {%- for h in also -%}{%- assign hk = h | strip -%}{%- if hk == blank or also_n >= 8 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}{%- assign hkey = ',' | append: hk | append: ',' -%}{%- if also_seen contains hkey -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}{%- assign ap = all_products[hk] -%}{%- if ap != blank and ap.available and ap.handle != p.handle -%}{%- assign also_seen = also_seen | append: hk | append: ',' -%}{%- assign also_n = also_n | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- assign afl = '' -%}{%- assign asub = '' -%}{%- case ap.handle -%}{%- when 'pocket-era-r36s-ultra-x' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-ultramax.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '4.5-inch · up to 40K games' -%}{%- when 'pocket-era-r36s-ultra' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-r36s-ultra.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '4-inch · up to 40K games' -%}{%- when 'pocket-era-r36-pro-2' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-r36s-pro.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '3.5-inch · up to 40K games' -%}{%- when 'pocket-era-r36h' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-r36h-pro.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '3.5-inch · up to 20K games' -%}{%- when 'pocket-era-r36h-ultra' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-r36h-ultra.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '4.2-inch · up to 30K games' -%}{%- when 'pocket-era-astronaut-galaxy-projector' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-projector.png' -%}{%- assign asub = 'Nebula · 8 modes' -%}{%- when 'legends-eden-hoodie' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-hoodie.png' -%}{%- assign asub = 'Hoodie blanket' -%}{%- when 'pokemon-crystal-ball-3d-pikachu-gengar-mewtwo-night-light-lamp-pokeball-3d-glass-pokemon-crystal-ball-statue-kids-birthday-gift' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-orb-v2.png' -%}{%- assign asub = 'Lit crystal orb' -%}{%- when 'mega-legends-plushie' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-plush.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '25 characters · Small or Large' -%}{%- when 'legends-ball-cushion' -%}{%- assign afl = 'pr-cut-ball.png' -%}{%- assign asub = '4 designs · Small or Large' -%}{%- endcase -%}
      <a class="pr-acard" href="{{ ap.url }}">
        <div class="pr-acard-ph{% if afl != '' %} pr-float{% endif %}">{%- if afl != '' -%}<img src="{{ afl | file_img_url: '700x' }}" alt="{{ ap.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="700" height="700">{%- else -%}<img src="{{ ap.featured_image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="{{ ap.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="700" height="700">{%- endif -%}</div>
        <h3>{%- if ap.title contains 'Ball Cushion' -%}{{ ap.title | remove_first: 'Pocket Era ' }}{%- else -%}{{ ap.title | remove_first: 'Pocket Era ' | remove_first: 'Legends ' }}{%- endif -%}</h3>
        {%- if asub != '' -%}<p class="pr-acard-sub">{{ asub }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign av = ap.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
        <p class="pr-acard-price">{%- if av.compare_at_price > av.price -%}<s>{{ av.compare_at_price | money }}</s>{%- endif -%}<span>{{ av.price | money }}</span>{%- if av.compare_at_price > av.price -%}{%- assign sv = av.compare_at_price | minus: av.price -%}<i class="pr-acard-save">Save {{ sv | money_without_trailing_zeros }} ({{ sv | times: 100 | divided_by: av.compare_at_price }}%)</i>{%- endif -%}</p><span class="pr-acard-btn">Shop now</span>
      </a>
      {%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
    </div>
    <div class="pr-also-rail" data-also-pane="recent" hidden></div>
  </div></section>
  {%- endif -%}

  <section class="pr-sec pr-sec-tight" id="pr-reviews"><div class="pr-wrap">
    <p class="pr-eyebrow">Reviews</p>
    <h2 class="pr-h2">{%- if rn > 0 -%}{{ ravg | round: 1 }} from {{ rn }} buyers.{%- elsif seedn > 0 -%}5.0 from {{ seedn }} buyers.{%- else -%}What buyers say.{%- endif -%}</h2>
    <div class="pr-reviews" id="pr-rv-wall" data-shop="{{ shop.permanent_domain }}" data-pid="{{ p.id }}" data-title="{{ p.title | escape }}" data-n="{{ rn }}" {% if jm %}data-v="{{ jm.metafield_updated_at }}"{% endif %}>
      <div class="pr-rv-list">{%- if s.photo_reviews != blank -%}{%- assign shots = s.photo_reviews | split: ' | ' -%}{%- for sh in shots -%}{%- assign f = sh | split: '~' -%}<article class="pr-rvw pr-rvw-seed"><div class="pr-rvw-top"><span class="pr-rvw-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span>{%- assign nm = f[1] | strip -%}<span class="pr-rvw-meta">{%- if nm != blank -%}{{ nm }}{%- endif -%}</span></div><p>{{ f[0] | strip }}</p>{%- if f[2] != blank -%}<div class="pr-rvw-pics"><img src="{{ f[2] | strip }}&width=200" alt="Buyer photo" loading="lazy" width="96" height="96"></div>{%- endif -%}</article>{%- endfor -%}{%- endif -%}</div>
      <div class="pr-rv-more"><button type="button" class="pr-btn pr-btn-ghost pr-btn-sm pr-rv-btn" hidden>Show more reviews</button></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

</div>

<script type="application/json" id="pr-data">{"kit":{{ kit_id }},"colorOpt":{{ color_pos }},"variants":[{%- for v in p.variants -%}{"id":{{ v.id }},"p":{{ v.price }},"cap":{{ v.compare_at_price | default: 0 }},"o1":{{ v.option1 | json }},"o2":{{ v.option2 | json }},"cm":{{ v.metafields.custom.size_cm.value | default: '' | json }},"av":{{ v.available }},"media":{{ v.featured_media.id | default: 0 }}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{%- endfor -%}]}</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "PR Product",
  "settings": [
    {"type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title override", "info": "Empty = product title without 'Pocket Era' / 'Legends'"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "subtitle", "label": "Line under the title"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "tag", "label": "Tag chip (New, Bundle...)"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "crumb", "label": "Breadcrumb parent", "default": "Shop"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "crumb_url", "label": "Breadcrumb parent URL", "default": "/collections/shop-all"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "swatch_label", "label": "Swatch label", "default": "Color"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "rows_label", "label": "Pack rows label", "default": "Pick your pack"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "bundles", "label": "Pack rows", "info": "label ~ option1 value (empty when the only option is the colour) ~ qty ~ dollars off ~ kit 1/0 ~ default 1/0 ~ sub ~ tag ~ pay units (BXGY) ~ offmode each|total; rows split by |"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "kit_handle", "label": "$0 protection kit handle (rides with kit=1 rows)"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "kit_items", "label": "What's in the protection kit (items split by |)"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "addons", "label": "Add-on rows", "info": "handle ~ label ~ sub line, rows split by |"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "cta", "label": "Button", "default": "Add to bag"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "cta_note", "label": "Line under the button", "default": "Free tracked shipping · ships in 1 to 2 business days"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "pains", "label": "Icon grid (4)", "info": "icon ~ title ~ small line, split by |. Icons: games screen battery light wifi speaker size remote timer usb warm star rotate orb glow shelf set hood pad tape sd rainbow"},
    {"type": "richtext", "id": "description", "label": "Description override", "info": "Empty = product description"},
    {"type": "checkbox", "id": "open_desc", "label": "Description open by default", "default": false},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "specs", "label": "Tech specs", "info": "name ~ value, split by |"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "box", "label": "In the box", "info": "items split by |"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "shipping", "label": "Shipping text"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "faq", "label": "Extra drop-downs", "info": "question ~ answer, split by |"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "photo_reviews", "label": "Seed reviews", "info": "Used when Judge.me has none. text ~ name ~ photo URL, rows split by |"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "also", "label": "You may also like handles, comma separated"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "lead", "label": "Lead photo URL (glove shot, shown first)"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "clip", "label": "Clip (mp4 asset name or URL, 2nd slide)"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "clip_poster", "label": "Clip poster URL"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "float", "label": "Floating cutout file name (2nd slide)"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "play_tabs", "label": "Module 1 tabs", "info": "label ~ image URL or asset, rows split by |; overrides photo A/B"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "tabs2_title", "label": "Module 2 heading (non-consoles)"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "tabs2", "label": "Module 2 tabs", "info": "label ~ image URL or asset, rows split by |; used when there are no size tabs"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "play_on", "label": "Switch module: photo A"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "play_off", "label": "Switch module: photo B"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "play_eyebrow", "label": "Switch eyebrow", "default": "Lights down"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "play_title", "label": "Switch heading", "default": "Lights down. Rings on."},
    {"type": "text", "id": "play_text", "label": "Switch line"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "play_on_label", "label": "Switch label A", "default": "Room lights on"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "play_off_label", "label": "Switch label B", "default": "Lights down"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "sizes", "label": "Size tabs", "info": "label ~ inches ~ caption, split by |; last = this product"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "size_img", "label": "Size module screen image (asset or URL)"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "size_eyebrow", "label": "Size eyebrow", "default": "Screen size"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "size_title", "label": "Size heading", "default": "See the difference."},
    {"type": "text", "id": "size_text", "label": "Size line", "default": "The same game, sized by the diagonal. Tap a size."},
    {"type": "text", "id": "mods", "label": "Module order", "info": "comma list: play, tabs2, size, math, hem"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "kickers", "label": "Module kickers", "info": "module ~ small line, split by |"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "math_title", "label": "Math heading"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "math_rows", "label": "Math systems", "info": "name ~ used price, split by |"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "math_them", "label": "Math them label"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "math_them_sub", "label": "Math them line"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "math_us_sub", "label": "Math us line"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "math_note", "label": "Math source line"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "hem_title", "label": "Hem heading"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "hem_rows", "label": "Hem tabs", "info": "label ~ height cm ~ caption, split by |"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "hem_len", "label": "Hem length cm"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "hem_note", "label": "Hem note"}
  ],
  "presets": [{"name": "PR Product"}]
}
{% endschema %}

